{"id":"5fedc3d970ff1b8b","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-ph-contained-pspace.md","title":"PH is Contained in PSPACE","display":"thm-ph-contained-pspace — PH is Contained in PSPACE","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-ph-contained-pspace","aliases":["28-thm-ph-contained-pspace","PH is contained in PSPACE"],"display":"thm-ph-contained-pspace — PH is Contained in PSPACE","depends_on":["[[28-df-ph]]","[[28-df-pspace]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-ph-contained-pspace"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-ph-contained-pspace</span><span>PH is contained in PSPACE</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ph-contained-pspace — PH is Contained in PSPACE"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3490cd4d54ac2474\" href=\"?note=3490cd4d54ac2474\" title=\"28-df-ph\">28-df-ph</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fd829148f31abddc\" href=\"?note=fd829148f31abddc\" title=\"28-df-pspace\">28-df-pspace</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{PH}\">\\(\\mathbf{PH}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{PSPACE}\">\\(\\mathbf{PSPACE}\\)</span> 见本目录定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{PH}\\subseteq\\mathbf{PSPACE}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{PH}\\subseteq\\mathbf{PSPACE}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对固定语言的固定有限量词块作深度优先枚举，只保存各块当前多项式长度赋值、枚举计数器及末尾多项式时间谓词的工作空间。指数数量分支可逐一重用空间，因此总空间仍为多项式。</p>\n<p>来源核对：§5.2.2末段；印刷98页；PDF124页。包含陈述已核对；枚举推导为本地展开。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-ph","status":"resolved","id":"3490cd4d54ac2474","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-ph]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-pspace","status":"resolved","id":"fd829148f31abddc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-pspace]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf{PH}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{PSPACE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{PH}\\subseteq\\mathbf{PSPACE}.","display":true}],"bytes":910,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-85","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"层级关系：[[28-thm-atm-characterizes-ph]]、[[28-thm-ph-contained-pspace]]、[[28-thm-ph-collapse]]、[[28-thm-karp-lipton]]。"}],"outgoing":["3490cd4d54ac2474","fd829148f31abddc"]}